 "remarks": "*OPEN HOUSES CANCELLED* This might be the only home in Greenwich where every level brings you closer to a waterfall! Located in Glenville, this fully staged 2-bedroom, 2.5-bath townhouse offers approximately 1,800 SF across three beautifully transformed levels. Nearly every area has been redesigned and made brand new. The open main level features a new kitchen with custom cabinetry, under-cabinet lighting, new countertops, backsplash, storage, and stainless-steel appliances, plus a dining area, fireplace, TV wall, new half bath, and concealed in-unit laundry. The primary suite overlooks the waterfall and features a wet bar with refrigeration, fireplace, custom closet, and a fully renovated bath with heated floors, glass-enclosed shower, floating vanity, heated anti-fog mirror, and electric toilet. The flexible lower level can serve as a guest room, gym, or office and includes a renovated bath, large closet, and patio access. Built-in speakers, brand-new windows and exterior doors, outdoor spaces, Greenwich Public Schools, and easy access to downtown complete this exceptional home.",
